+### Including multiple mapping configurations
+
+A mapping method can include several configurations, for example one per implemented interface:
+
+```csharp
+[MapProperty(nameof(IAudit.CreatedBy), nameof(IAuditDto.Creator))]
+public partial static void MapAudit(IAudit audit, IAuditDto dto);
+
+[MapProperty(nameof(IOwnable.Owner), nameof(IOwnableDto.OwnerName))]
+public partial static void MapOwnable(IOwnable ownable, IOwnableDto dto);
+
+// highlight-start
+[IncludeMappingConfiguration(nameof(MapAudit))]
+[IncludeMappingConfiguration(nameof(MapOwnable))]
+// highlight-end
+public partial static HouseDto ToDto(House house);
+```
+
